+Two cases first failed on the correct code, and the fault was the battery's: they required a
+level-zero summary to be exactly its own record after towers had been removed, but removal folds
+the removed cell's summary into its predecessor, leaving a conservative bound by design.
+Exactness is now required only while nothing has been removed.
