+
+The battery built at `-O0` with coverage instrumentation, run once (22/22), measured on
+`PagedBTreeConflictSet.cpp` with LLVM 19.1.5 (`llvm-cov export --summary-only`):
+
+| measure | covered | total | % |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| lines | 637 | 649 | 98.2 |
+| functions | 54 | 55 | 98.2 |
+| branches | 363 | 424 | 85.6 |
+| MC/DC conditions | 37 | 41 | 90.2 |
+| regions | 587 | 695 | 84.5 |
