+**Results on the tree, with FDB's libraries:** 28/28 in each of these builds:
+- normal;
+- `SANITIZE=1`;
+- `BTREE_SEARCH_STATS=0`;
+- `BTREE_FLAGS=-DPAGED_BTREE_WRITE_PREFETCH=0`;
