+## Staged suffix anticipation (step 5, 2026-10-01)
+
+The patch `paso-5-prefetch` replaces section 36's suffix prefetch (P/D), with its options
+`directSuffixPrefetch`, `suffixPrefetchLevels` and `suffixLeafLookahead`, by an opt-in staged
+anticipation for F's internal comparisons:
