+This battery's `reclamationDuringReservationSharedPrefix` failed its precondition under the
+automatic split: with five pages no batch reached the discard path. Its other checks passed.
+- **Why.** With permanent shares one side binds at a time: one index page gives node reclamation
+  without discards, and more give discards without node reclamation.
+- **The sweep.** 3 to 8 pages, in five layouts (K = 16 at C = 15 and 23, K = 32/C = 31, K = 0,
+  inline-only). Only `{3, 1}` and `{2, 1}` make both happen for both seeds in every layout.
