+Merging their profiles is unreliable, because the same functions are compiled differently:
+`llvm-profdata` reports mismatches, and the merged MC/DC exceeds 100%. So each build is exported
+on its own (`llvm-cov export` and `llvm-cov show --show-branches=count`) and the union is taken by
+source location:
