+**The change.** `PAGED_BTREE_GROUP_SWEEP` (default 0) selects `readBreadthGroups` when breadthBatch is requested.
+Below the bisection levels each node has one cursor that sweeps its separators, or a leaf's bounds, and the node's
+sorted endpoints together. There is no pending task per comparison. Heap windows are requested by blocks of
+queries and by bound. Performance record, section 69 on `hetzner/breadthGroupSweep`.
