+**New cases.**
+- `breadthGroupSweepSharedWindows`. Many queries in one leaf, with short and long suffixes. It checks:
+  - the decisions;
+  - one heap resolution per key;
+  - many comparisons per cursor visit;
+  - rounds shared by long keys;
+  - both prefetch modes.
+- `breadthGroupSweepMonotoneCuts`. It covers:
+  - several nodes, points and ranges, and crossings;
+  - old read versions exactly at the bounds;
+  - bisection depths 0 to 3 and three budgets.
+- `breadthResumeLengths`. Unequal lengths and windows of 1, 17, 64 and 128 bytes; carried from the suffix-resume
+  experiment, without its component.
