+| next boundary skips one (local-end path) | 90/109: 19 cases, by decision checks against the reference |
+| local mask loses its highest boundary (G 3 only) | 89/109, by decision checks |
+| local mask loses its lowest boundary | 109/109: equivalent, the loop never looks below the current boundary |
+| G 4 accepted | 108/109, `readerConfigValidation` |
